{"ref":"BDB, רִקְמָה","hw":"רִקְמָה","html":"† <big><span dir=\"rtl\">רִקְמָה</span></big>  <strong>n.f. variegated stuff</strong> (woven or embroidered);—abs. <span dir=\"rtl\">ר׳</span> <a data-ref=\"Judges 5:30\" href=\"/Judges.5.30\">Ju 5:30</a> +; sf. <span dir=\"rtl\">רִקְמָתֵךְ</span> <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 16:18\" href=\"/Ezekiel.16.18\">Ez 16:18</a>, -<span dir=\"rtl\">תָם</span> <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 26:16\" href=\"/Ezekiel.26.16\">26:16</a>; du. <span dir=\"rtl\">רִקְמָתַיִם</span> <a data-ref=\"Judges 5:30\" href=\"/Judges.5.30\">Ju 5:30</a>; pl. <span dir=\"rtl\">רְקָמוֹת</span> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 45:15\" href=\"/Psalms.45.15\">ψ 45:15</a>;—(piece of) <em>variegated stuff</em>, <a data-ref=\"Judges 5:30\" href=\"/Judges.5.30\">Ju 5:30</a><sup>(×2)</sup>, for garments <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 16:10\" href=\"/Ezekiel.16.10\">Ez 16:10</a>, <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 16:13\" href=\"/Ezekiel.16.13\">13</a>; <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 27:16\" href=\"/Ezekiel.27.16\">27:16</a>, <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 27:24\" href=\"/Ezekiel.27.24\">24</a> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 45:15\" href=\"/Psalms.45.15\">ψ 45:15</a>; explicitly, <span dir=\"rtl\">בִּגְדֵי ר׳</span> <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 16:18\" href=\"/Ezekiel.16.18\">Ez 16:18</a>; <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 26:16\" href=\"/Ezekiel.26.16\">26:16</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">ר׳</span> appar. = <em>variegated work</em> <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 27:7\" href=\"/Ezekiel.27.7\">27:7</a>; fig. of variegated plumage <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 17:3\" href=\"/Ezekiel.17.3\">17:3</a>; of variegated stone <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 29:2\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.29.2\">1 Ch 29:2</a>.","next":"BDB, רֶ֫קֶם","prev":"BDB, רָקַם"}